        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Farvival, you can grow crops in the fields, raise animals, and use an axe or pickaxe to collect materials to craft a variety of items. We especially recommend cigarettes, which you can craft from the start of the game. They have no effect on your status, but they add a great atmosphere to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast, procedurally generated map while smoking a cigarette!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/cd3775232a5c9bf79b1395dea4320fa7.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=452 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/cd3775232a5c9bf79b1395dea4320fa7.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/cd3775232a5c9bf79b1395dea4320fa7.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An ideal survival life with farming, building, and fishing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a slow-paced survival lifestyle by growing a variety of crops in your fields, fishing in the ocean, and cutting down trees to build a home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/1c9b303a3eee8377164be44062121982.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=464 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/1c9b303a3eee8377164be44062121982.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/1c9b303a3eee8377164be44062121982.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live with adorable animals! Ride a horse!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adopt animals such as chickens, pigs, and cows. Horses, in particular, can be ridden once they grow up, and will become your wonderful companion as you race through the vast, randomly generated world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/eb7d03b2b9fe391dae8500479f5d73f9.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=502 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/eb7d03b2b9fe391dae8500479f5d73f9.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/eb7d03b2b9fe391dae8500479f5d73f9.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The forest is full of dangerous monsters and materials!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The starting natural biome is safe, but in the forest biome, spiders and mushroom monsters are on the lookout, waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the materials that can only be obtained from them may be useful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/09607b72eb37bb95518900f924e86dad.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/09607b72eb37bb95518900f924e86dad.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/09607b72eb37bb95518900f924e86dad.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is it dangerous to just eat something? Be careful of dangerous mushrooms and suspicious meat that can be obtained from monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wild animals can be eaten normally, monsters and mushrooms growing deep in the forest are poisonous and dangerous to eat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps if you build a cooking table you can get rid of the poison and eat them...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the world of Farvival!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have complete freedom in how you live your life in a dangerous world! Start your own slow life now!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Farvival, you can grow crops in the fields, raise animals, and use an axe or pickaxe to collect materials to craft a variety of items. We especially recommend cigarettes, which you can craft from the start of the game. They have no effect on your status, but they add a great atmosphere to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast, procedurally generated map while smoking a cigarette!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/cd3775232a5c9bf79b1395dea4320fa7.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=452 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/cd3775232a5c9bf79b1395dea4320fa7.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/cd3775232a5c9bf79b1395dea4320fa7.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An ideal survival life with farming, building, and fishing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a slow-paced survival lifestyle by growing a variety of crops in your fields, fishing in the ocean, and cutting down trees to build a home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/1c9b303a3eee8377164be44062121982.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=464 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/1c9b303a3eee8377164be44062121982.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/1c9b303a3eee8377164be44062121982.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live with adorable animals! Ride a horse!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adopt animals such as chickens, pigs, and cows. Horses, in particular, can be ridden once they grow up, and will become your wonderful companion as you race through the vast, randomly generated world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/eb7d03b2b9fe391dae8500479f5d73f9.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=502 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/eb7d03b2b9fe391dae8500479f5d73f9.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/eb7d03b2b9fe391dae8500479f5d73f9.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The forest is full of dangerous monsters and materials!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The starting natural biome is safe, but in the forest biome, spiders and mushroom monsters are on the lookout, waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the materials that can only be obtained from them may be useful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/09607b72eb37bb95518900f924e86dad.poster.avif?t=1765359182\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/09607b72eb37bb95518900f924e86dad.webm?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166860/extras/09607b72eb37bb95518900f924e86dad.mp4?t=1765359182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is it dangerous to just eat something? Be careful of dangerous mushrooms and suspicious meat that can be obtained from monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wild animals can be eaten normally, monsters and mushrooms growing deep in the forest are poisonous and dangerous to eat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps if you build a cooking table you can get rid of the poison and eat them...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the world of Farvival!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have complete freedom in how you live your life in a dangerous world! Start your own slow life now!</p>",
        "short_description": "Farvival is a game that combines the words &quot;farm&quot; and &quot;survival.&quot; While smoking cigarettes, you can use axes and pickaxes to collect materials in a vast, procedurally generated map, defeat dangerous monsters, and enjoy a slow life of building and farming!",
